@StudentRegistration.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5066
@studentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@subjectId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### ========== ESTUDIANTES ==========

### Obtener todos los estudiantes
GET {{StudentRegistration.Api_HostAddress}}/api/students
Accept: application/json

###

### Obtener estudiante por ID
GET {{StudentRegistration.Api_HostAddress}}/api/students/{{studentId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Crear nuevo estudiante
POST {{StudentRegistration.Api_HostAddress}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Juan",
  "lastName": "Pérez",
  "email": "juan.perez@example.com"
}

###

### Actualizar estudiante
PUT {{StudentRegistration.Api_HostAddress}}/api/students/{{studentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Juan Carlos",
  "lastName": "Pérez García",
  "email": "juan.perez@example.com"
}

###

### Eliminar estudiante
DELETE {{StudentRegistration.Api_HostAddress}}/api/students/{{studentId}}

###

### Obtener compañeros de clase del estudiante
GET {{StudentRegistration.Api_HostAddress}}/api/students/{{studentId}}/classmates
Accept: application/json

###

### ========== ASIGNATURAS ==========

### Obtener todas las asignaturas
GET {{StudentRegistration.Api_HostAddress}}/api/subjects
Accept: application/json

###

### Obtener asignatura por ID
GET {{StudentRegistration.Api_HostAddress}}/api/subjects/{{subjectId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Obtener asignaturas disponibles para un estudiante
GET {{StudentRegistration.Api_HostAddress}}/api/subjects/available/{{studentId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### ========== INSCRIPCIONES ==========

### Inscribir estudiante en asignaturas (máximo 3)
POST {{StudentRegistration.Api_HostAddress}}/api/inscriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "{{studentId}}",
  "subjectIds": [
    "{{subjectId}}"
  ]
}

###

### Desinscribir estudiante de una asignatura
DELETE {{StudentRegistration.Api_HostAddress}}/api/inscriptions/{{studentId}}/subjects/{{subjectId}}

###

### Obtener inscripciones de un estudiante
GET {{StudentRegistration.Api_HostAddress}}/api/inscriptions/students/{{studentId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Obtener estudiantes de una asignatura
GET {{StudentRegistration.Api_HostAddress}}/api/inscriptions/subjects/{{subjectId}}/students
Accept: application/json

###
